dictionary=supplement:en,locale=en,description=Glyf supplement to the AOSP English list: everyday texting, India, apps,version=1
# Merged into the base list by tools/build_dictionary.py. The AOSP list dates
# from 2014: it lacks how people text today and most Indian proper nouns, and
# only knows "OK" in capitals. Frequencies are on AOSP's 0-255 scale
# (the=222, year=169, hello=120). Bigram f values are absolute.
